    ],
    "text": "I, Hanif Yusuf, the Governor of the Western Province, do hereby announce that according to the powers vested in me as per Sub-section (1) of Section 38 of the Rent Act No. 07 of 1972 read with Section 02 of the Provincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act No. 12 of 1989, I have decided that there shall be II Rent Boards within the Western Province and the Local Government Authority Area / Local Government Authority Areas relevant to each Rent Board set out in Column I of the Schedule heretounder has been set out correspondingly in Column II of the said Schedule and the place where each such Rent Board is conducted should be as depicted in Column III thereof. It is hereby further announced that the order published in Provincial Councils Section in Part IV(A) in No. 1561 dated 01.08.2008 be annulled hereby and this announcement shall take e\ufb00 ect from 01st of September 2025.",
